# Byproducts of the produce smoke, whether run by hand from the README or by the CI job. They land in
# the working directory because the two hosts write to stdout and the step redirects them; keeping them
# untracked is what stops a local run from showing up as pending changes.
api.log
consumer.log
publish-*.log
baseline-*.log
response.json
